/F1 10 Tf (BUREAU OF INDIAN STANDARDS ACT, 2016) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (An Act to provide for the establishment of a national standards body of India.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (CHAPTER I: PRELIMINARY) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Section 1. Short Title and Commencement: This Act may be called the Bureau of Indian Standards Act, 2016.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Section 2. Definitions: In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (\(a\) 'Bureau' means the Bureau of Indian Standards established under section 3;) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (\(b\) 'conformity assessment' means demonstration that specified requirements are fulfilled;) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (\(c\) 'Indian Standard' means standard established and published by the Bureau;) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (\(d\) 'Standard Mark' means the BIS Mark specified by the Bureau to represent an Indian Standard.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (The Act came into force on 12th October 2017 to strengthen standardisation and consumer protection.) Tj T*
ET
