10 0 obj
<< /Length 821 >>
stream
BT
/F2 14 Tf
50 740 Td
/F2 12 Tf (CHAPTER III: PENALTIES AND ENFORCEMENT) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Section 29. Penalties for Contravention:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Any person who contravenes the provisions of section 15 \(unauthorized standard mark usage\) shall be punishable with:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (1. Imprisonment for a term which may extend up to two years, OR) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (2. Fine which shall not be less than two lakh rupees, but may extend up to ten times the value of goods.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Section 30. Compounding of Offences:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Offences under this Act may be compounded by the authorized officer before or after the institution of prosecution.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (The Act empowers BIS officers to search premises, inspect quality, and seize sub-standard counterfeit articles.) Tj T*
ET
